1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,537
GTA 6: Everything You Need to Know.

2
00:00:03,487 --> 00:00:16,087
Grand Theft Auto 6 is officially launching on November 19, 2026, exclusively for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S at a price point of $79.99.

3
00:00:16,087 --> 00:00:22,825
Pre-orders opened on June 25, and demand has been unprecedented across major retailers worldwide.

4
00:00:22,825 --> 00:00:33,637
In a controversial move, the game ships without a physical disc — the box contains only a download code, marking the first mainline GTA entry to go digital-only at retail.

5
00:00:33,637 --> 00:00:41,875
The story follows dual protagonists Jason and Lucia through the neon-lit streets of Vice City, Rockstar's fictional take on Florida.

6
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:49,387
A third trailer, expected to showcase the first proper gameplay footage, is slated for release in August 2026.

7
00:00:49,387 --> 00:01:00,925
With over a decade since GTA V first launched, anticipation for this title has reached historic levels, and analysts predict it will become the fastest-selling entertainment product of all time.

